    "title": "Former Wells ISD Teacher Faces New Child Indecency Charge - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Angelina County, Texas\nFormer Wells ISD Teacher Faces New Child Indecency Charge\nBy Dan Patrick,\n6 hours agoIn February, two people, one of whom was a teacher for Wells ISD, were arrested on charges of possession of child pornography and a bestiality charge. Now the former Wells ISD teacher, Hillary Danielle Williams, 34, of Lufkin, is being charged with indecency with a child. Williams was re-arrested after a child made an outcry.",
